# Boot -> title -> map zoom-out loading -> free roam, then the script ends and the dev pad quits the game (mcla_pad_exit_on_end, the window's RequestClose).
# For launcher/dev/exit_probe.py (the exit hang). Run it without --keep-open.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 5s
log exit: end of the script
mark end
